WEBVTT

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.250
Fujiwara Zakuro, Momoka loves you!!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.170
Wow!! Cuuuute!!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.680
It’s a birthday cake!!

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.180
Hey, who’s birthday is it?

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.150
If I’m not mistaken,
it’s for the daycare nearby.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:43.140
Yes, it’s for Momoka-chan’s
6th birthday.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:48.650
Well, since I’m a big sister to her, does that mean I’ll get a bigger cake or my birthday?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:49.820
That’s funny, Bu-Ling.

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:53.150
Should I deliver it now?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.740
Yes, please do.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.920
I should’ve worn a coat.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.470
Ahh... Aoyama-kun?!

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.720
Ichigo? What’s the matter?

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.350
Nothing. Just delivering a cake, that’s all.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.100
Are you alright?

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.020
Yeah... sorry.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.360
Better not catch a cold. Put this on.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.280
Aoyama-kun...?

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.940
Sorry for the delay, this is from Café Mew Mew!!

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.870
Are you Momoka-chan?

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:33.530
Yeah.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.730
TAADAA!!

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.000
A very Happy Birthday to you!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.580
It’s a Café Mew Mew Special –
A Strawberry Birthday Cake!

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.370
These things are high in calories, aren’t they?

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.760
Momoka-chan?!

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:52.050
Momoka-chan, why are you worrying
about calories at your age?

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.850
My dream is to be like Fujiwara Zakuro.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.600
If I’m not careful, won’t I end up like you, obasan?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.390
Obasan...?!!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.220
Why you little...!!

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:02.220
There, there.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.060
Bleh...!!

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.520
Not cute whatsoever!!!

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.020
Itadakimasu!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:14.620
Wahh! Everyone’s eating,
they’re eating...

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:15.420
Huh?

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:22.500
Look! That girl is imitating
Zakuro’s poses.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.330
She really idolizes her.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:28.830
Yeah, but she won’t even try the cake we brought for her.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:34.690
On top of that, that girl doesn’t seem
to interact with the other kids.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.550
Huh?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:47.660
I just delivered a birthday cake to this
girl who’s a big fan of Zakuro’s.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.580
You just can’t help but notice that she’s a loner.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.830
Minto, you’re so nice to give us a
ride home in this beautiful car.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.380
It’s just a ride. No big deal.

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:12.390
I was only planning on giving
Zakuro-’neesama a ride home.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.800
You just invited yourself...

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.300
Ah! This is where I delivered the
birthday cake to this afternoon.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.470
Ah! It’s Momoka-chan.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.970
No one picked her up yet.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.080
Even at this hour.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:42.840
Zakuro-’neesama, if you don’t mind,
would you like to have dinner at my place?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.870
Sorry. I have a staff meeting for my next movie later on.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.420
That’s too bad.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:53.880
Hey, hey I still have some time left in my schedule.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.930
Then, we’ll do it next time.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.670
I see.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.520
That child.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:28.030
Momoka chan, your Father and Mother
will be a little late due to work.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.340
Would you like to start first?

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.250
Momoka is not hungry yet.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.860
This displays where Mew Aqua is most likely to be found.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:05.450
Since it’s on the move, they’re
probably in the hands of humans.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.300
Excellent. It’s worth checking out, I suppose.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:11.910
You think those Mew Mew fellows detected it yet?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:18.380
These points have reached the 10-Point
mark; it seems, we must investigate.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.550
Excellent. Let’s do it first thing in the morning.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.380
Yeah.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:30.640
What we are saying is... we can’t
do the movie without you.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.520
Since you have so much confidence in me
I shall do my best.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.980
That would be fantastic.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.000
Momoka-chan.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.450
Your Father and Mother just called.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.750
They’re still delayed with work.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.880
So after dinner, Momoka will be driven home.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.750
Momoka doesn’t want any dinner!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.930
After all, I’m on a diet!

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:00.920
Hey.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.350
Momoka-chan?!

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.270
I’m sorry.
Please excuse me for a moment.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.610
We already agreed to have dinner
together on my birthday.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.240
Papa and Mama both don’t like Momoka.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.330
What’s the matter?
Why are you standing there?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.530
Huh?! Fujiwara Zakuro?

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.010
Is that you?!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:34.660
It’s me.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:36.630
Wow!!!

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.670
There, let’s wipe away those tears.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:39.600
Oh.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.040
What’s your name?

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.300
I’m Momoka.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.130
I’m one of Zakuro’s biggest fans.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.230
I see, thank you.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.010
Why did you cry?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.640
Today happens to be Momoka’s birthday.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:58.020
However, due to their busy schedules,
Papa and Mama couldn’t make it.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.020
I see. Sorry to hear that.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.950
But... how about I tell you something
that will make you feel better?

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:04.690
Huh?

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:09.660
Even though, your Papa and Mama
couldn’t have dinner with you today,

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.110
they actually love you a hundred times more than that.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:14.490
Really?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.000
Really.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:18.380
You promise?

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:19.390
Yeah.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:28.050
Cut your finger and promise, break it and you’ll have to swallow a thousand needles!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.520
It’s a promise!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:34.610
Well, now let’s have dinner so we can go home.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.810
Momoka doesn’t want any.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.600
Why not?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.610
Momoka wants to be just
like Zakuro-san,

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.560
so I’ve been on a diet.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.110
Personally, I don’t believe in diets.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.070
Huh?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:50.990
Having proper meals and exercising regularly,

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:53.660
one can have a naturally beautiful
healthy body, understand?

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.500
Yup!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:56.790
Good girl.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.500
May I have dinner with you?

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.620
Really?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.840
Yeah. Well, let’s go then.

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.540
What about this handkerchief...

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.880
You can keep it.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.270
It’s a birthday present from me.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:12.170
Wow, thank you!!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:19.610
Begging your pardon,
but I must leave now.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:20.270
Huh?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.660
It just so happens to be my little Fan’s Birthday.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.660
Momoka has already gone to bed.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:06.450
Looks like she cried... even on her birthday.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.040
Papa, did you prepare a present?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.830
Ah, of course I did.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:19.080
I got this while visiting
a friend in England.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.630
According to my friend, it’s comprised of precious gems.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.920
Seeing its beauty, I bought the pendant.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:32.270
Since this is Momoka’s present,
I’ll give it to her tomorrow morning.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.440
Is that so...?

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.070
Good morning, Momoka.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:47.560
Good morning.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.560
Good morning.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:53.370
Sorry about last evening, we could
not make it to the restaurant.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:57.370
However Papa and Mama have
prepared a present for Momoka.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.030
Huh?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.000
Here, this is it.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.380
Wah!! So pretty!!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:06.250
Although it’s a day late...
Happy birthday.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.960
Hurry, let’s see you put it on.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:08.830
Wah!!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.500
Thank you!!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.220
As for the Daycare’s picnic
this Sunday,

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.810
Papa and Mama will definitely be there to join you.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.140
Really?!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.810
Yes. Papa won’t have any problems
with that, now would you?

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.350
Of course not.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:30.900
<i>Even though, your Papa and Mama couldn’t
have dinner with you today,</i>

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.320
<i>they actually love you a hundred times more than that.</i>

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.630
What Zakuro-san said before turned out to be true.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:45.670
Today, were searching for more
clues about about Mew Aqua.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:46.700
The weather looks pretty good.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.170
It’ll be like sunbathing.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:52.430
Retasu-neesan! Don’t get distracted.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:55.670
Finding Mew Aqua is top priority at moment.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:11:00.680
The Mew Aqua sensor revealed some Mew Aqua that was moving on the map.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.690
What forms these Mew Aqua has taken or
who has them has yet to be determined.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:08.350
How are we supposed to search for them then?

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.320
Listen! You are all Mew Mews!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.550
Mew Aqua will react to your bodies!

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:17.530
What the...!? You must be joking?

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.830
Hmm, they’re still not convinced...

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.320
No matter, shall we go?

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:30.370
Today, let’s all have fun with Dad and Mom, shall we?

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.690
Yes!!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.620
Momoka chan.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.120
Momoka-chan,

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:44.850
until your parents finish their work, why don’t you let the teachers take you around?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:45.940
They’re not coming.

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:46.860
Huh?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:48.940
They’re not coming at all.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.990
Momoka will go play alone!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:53.990
Momoka-chan...!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.230
What a nice place this is.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.490
A little smaller than my inner courtyard,

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.920
but otherwise decent.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.210
All, this is so fun.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:12.850
How nice to see kids having fun everywhere they go.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.680
But how long must we
keep searching?

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:19.010
If we don’t use our feelings how
can we have any reaction?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:23.680
Up till now it had always been sad moments that invoked the strongest reactions.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.320
That is hard to bring out.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.230
What’s the matter, Oneesama?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.530
What is it?

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:33.730
Those are...

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.240
children from the Daycare.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:40.570
Wah!! Sharing their lunchboxes with Dad and Mom!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.990
I’m so jealous!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.200
They must have organized
a school picnic.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.200
Everyone can’t be at the same place by chance.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.210
Huh?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:52.000
That child, Momoka seems to be absent.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.120
I wonder what happened.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.330
Could she have taken leave, perhaps?

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:08.180
Papa and Mama seem to dislike Momoka after all.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.810
<i>That’s not true.</i>

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.950
<i>Papa and Mama love Momoka
a hundred times more than that.</i>

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:21.820
Huh?! Where is this place?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.750
Where is everybody?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.680
Ah! Zakuro-san’s handkerchief!!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:44.150
Everyone’s just having a picnic. We’re not going to find any signs of Mew Aqua there.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.100
Why don’t we split up and search?

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.320
I guess...

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.820
I’ll search upstream.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.900
If you find anything, please give us a call.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.610
Alright everyone, let’s go.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.520
Looks like I can’t go climbing trees anymore.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:10.410
Oh no! Zakuro-san’s handkerchief!!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.630
Young Lady, what are you
doing out here?

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.500
Who are you?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.460
My name is Quiche.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.080
What seems to be the problem?

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:25.550
First, Momoka got lost, then dropped a very precious handkerchief into the stream.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.970
That’s terrible.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.020
Would you like me to help?

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.100
Really?

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:31.970
Yeah.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.430
But in exchange,

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:38.740
you must give me that beautiful pendant of yours.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.700
This?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:45.900
No! This is what Papa and Mama
gave me as birthday present.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.200
I guess it can’t be helped.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.410
You’re never getting your handkerchief back...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.540
and you’re not going home,

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:55.240
so you’ll never see your Papa or Mama again.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.210
No way!!

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.690
This handkerchief...

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:11.680
Momoka-chan!!

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.480
Too bad.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:22.230
If you hand over that pendant, I’ll immediately send you back to your parents.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.910
Really?

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.610
Yeah.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.070
Of course.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.460
I understand. So, Momoka will give this to you.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.420
Thank you, there’s a good girl.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.790
Hold it right there!!

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.460
Just what are you doing with that girl?!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:43.260
Zakuro-san!!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.630
Quiche!! Get away from that girl now!!!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.310
Hand it over!

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.850
You can’t take that!!

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.260
I’ll take the Mew Aqua now.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.470
What the... could that be...

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.070
Momoka-chan!!!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:03.120
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.540
She’s only a child, but you still–

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.890
If you use your Mew powers,
this kid might lose her life.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.010
What are you doing?!

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.270
Not bad Quiche.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.230
Momoka-chan!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.390
Fu Rai Sen!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.980
Go! Chimera attack!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.370
That ought to quiet you down some.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.620
Let’s see if this source will react...

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.090
It failed?

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.730
So it wasn’t Mew Aqua after all.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.060
What the hell?

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.190
All the recent findings are like that.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.450
This is a waste of time.
Let’s go back first.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.240
Wha... Hey!!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.190
So, what shall I do with you?

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:29.860
Unforgivable.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.200
You have to be stronger than that...

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.440
Hold it right there!!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:35.920
Oneesama, don’t move!!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.240
Mew Mint!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.810
Are you alright? Mew Pomegranate?!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.670
This time, and the next time around,
you’ll keep picking on children.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.900
To let you do that freely...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.510
is just totally unacceptable!

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.190
It’s pointless if its not related to Mew Aqua.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:04.070
Bye Bye.

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:04.520
Wait!!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:07.830
Until next time we meet.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.950
That’s...

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.740
She hit me?!!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.220
Just you wait!!

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:35.430
Mew Pomegranate really went berserk this time.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:40.640
In reality, Quiche had long fallen
into Zakuro-oneechan’s snare.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.640
What does that mean?

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.830
I’m not so sure myself.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:47.910
Momoka-chan?

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.530
Momoka-chan?

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.610
Finally awake?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.160
Ah, Zakuro-oneechan.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:58.000
See your pendant, I got it back for you.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.530
Wah!! Thank you!!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:05.340
It’s such a precious present that Papa gave to me.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.430
And, the handkerchief as well.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:09.800
Wow!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:14.970
Momoka met a bad guy and Zakuro-san in my dream.

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.420
I see.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.270
Zakuro-san was really great.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:24.060
Momoka wants to be strong like Zakuro, too.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:28.440
So that when Papa and Mama aren’t
around, Momoka won’t feel lonely.

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:29.820
Momoka!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.400
Momoka-chan!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.360
Momoka!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.580
Wah!! It’s Papa and Mama!

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:38.620
Papa!!

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.320
Mama!!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:41.730
Momoka!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.280
Momoka!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.710
Papa!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:47.120
I’m sorry we got here late, Momoka.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.810
We brought some lunchboxes.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.350
Mama!!

00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:00.010
It turned out well for Momoka-chan.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.770
Yeah, it did.

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:04.730
That handkerchief belongs
to oneesama...

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.400
How? When?

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.400
Only just.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:14.200
Those parents won’t ever want to leave
Momoka-chan by herself again.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:17.660
I believe so.

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:26.800
Shirogane?! Where’s Shirogane?!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.070
Recently I turned into a cat after a kiss,

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:32.130
so I have to be careful when I’m
out on dates with Aoyama-kun.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:35.930
Nevermind that, please bring this out to serve our guests.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.920
Ah!! Cake!!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.390
No no, today, like any other day, I shall not give in.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:44.850
Well, there was this incident where
he really experienced a lot.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:48.670
Next episode:
“Shirogane’s Past — The Birth of Mew Mew”

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:53.060
In my case, compared to that incident,
there’s much to be said.
